<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Ndonde Hamba Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Bhalagatia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ja Apaulo kwa Bhagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bhagalatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bhag</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani Jammbone handa chiijandikwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Apaulo</para>
  <para style="imt">Nnongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Bhagalatia chikajandikwa na andundame Apaulo mu 1:1. Jenje nga Balua jibhakajandika Apaulo kwa mabhoga ga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha konokwe ku Galatia kwa muuda pakati ja chaaka cha 48 na 57 baada ja kubhelekwa Ayesu Kilisito. Jitendakulobholeka kubhee Bhalatia bhakibhanga bhandu bhabhakatamanga chilambo cha ku Galatia chichikabhee mu mamulaka ga utabahala gwa Chi Loma. Akaachomi bha ngani ja Bibilia bangahobhalelanga penipala pabhakabhee Apaulo muuda pabhatenditakujandika balua jenjeni, nambo bhandu bhajingi bhatendakuganikia kubhee jikajandikwa mu chilambo cha ku Efeso au ku Kuolinto. Apaulo akajaandika balua jenjeni kwa bhandu bhoa bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhabhabhilinge ku mabhoga ga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha ku Galatia, nga bhenibhala bhabhkibhanga Bhayahudi na bhanga Bhayahudi. Balua jenjeni jikaajandikwa kwa maana ngolongwa ili kukanangana na lijigano lya unami lilyaakapala bhandu bhabhahobhaloela Akilisito bhakagulange malagilo ga Chiyahudi gagabhile mu Lilagalo lya lolo handa chikubho cha maana muno mu kuhobhalela, kupunda muno nga lijigano lya kwaakina bhandu. Kukibha na libhoga lya bhandu nkati ja libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhabhakachikemanga Bhayuda bhabhakaakulumikianga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhainwange. Kabhele bhandu bhenabho bhakakonyanga kwa ngani ja mamulaka ga chindundame ga Apaulo. Apaulo akatetela undundame gwabhe kwa kukongolela ngani jabhe mu nniango gwa 1:11-2:14, na akatetela Ngani Jammbone ja Ayesu abhikuatambula kubhee ukomboi gukombola kupatikana kwa ndela ja kwaahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito, mu nniango gwa 2:16. Nga mabhokeo ga umbone yakubhee Annoongo atendakugulangia kwa bhandu na wala ukomboi ngakulupalila hikubho ya bhandu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gagabhile</para>
  <para style="io">Apaulo ajemeka kujandika balua jabhe kwa kwaachalimianga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bha ku Galatia, mu nniango gwa 1:1-5.</para>
  <para style="io">Ngapena Apaulo atendakongolela hikubho hichoko yabhe nweene, ili kuhitetela hikubho yabhe hiikondekwa ya kujigana na kulangia kubhee akajiga kutama kwa kukagula malagilo nambo akalepela, mu nniango gwa 1:6-2:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Hela hela atendakongolela muno kwa ngani ja upenyo gwa malagilo na umbone mu ukomboi, mu nniango gwa 3-4</para>
  <para style="io">Ngapena atendakukongoelala kachoko kwa namuna ja kutama kwa umomi gwammbone ya kwaahobhalela Akiisito, mu nniango gwa 5-6:10.</para>
  <para style="io">Apauloatendakujomolekea balua jabhe kwa kubhoa chalamu na lijopelo lya kupela abhikwakombokea kubhee kutindiganwa na Annoongo na kupanganwa kubhee mundu nnyono nga chilebhe chammbone muno kupeta malagilo na chelia ya panja, kulandana na jenijela chelia ja kukinwa, mu nniango gwa 6:11-18.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Nenga Apaulo nga jundendakujandika balua heje, ndekubhee andundame ngabha kwa kuhagulikwa na bhandu, wala ngabha kwa machili ga mundu, nambo ndekuhagulikwa na Ayesu Kilisito na Annoongo Atati jwaakayoa Ayesu. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Nenga na akanung'una bhoha bhabhabhilinge pamo na nenga tunchalimianga mabhoga ga bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito bhammilinge konokwe ku Galatia. <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Tutendakunnyopelanga umbone na kuhengwa kubhoka kwa Annoongo Atati bhitu na kubhoka kwa Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Akilisito akabhoa umomi gwabhe ligongo lya kuhuta mabohu gitu na kwa upalio gwa Annoongo Atati bhitu, ili akombole kutuokoa mu chilambo heche chibohu cha nangocheni. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Annoongo alumbalilwe machobha goa pangali kupela! Na hibhee henela.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jibhile Ngani Jammbone jimo tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ndendakangacha muno kubhee munnekitinge chindema, henela jonojwe juntekumkemanga kwa umbone gwa Akilisito na kujikagula Ngani Jammbone jengi. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Nambo jakwa Ngani Jammbone jengi. Ukweli nga kubhee bhabhilinge bhandu bhabhanhangabhananga mwangota, bhandu bhabhapala kujigalambua Ngani Jammbone ja Akilisito. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Nambo, hata ikibha jumo jwitu au bhatumichi bha kunani kwa Annoongo, bhapakuntangachianga Ngani Jammbone jengi na kuleka jenijela tujitekutangachanga twenga, bahi Annoongo apakuntenda mundu jonojwe ahikilwe na chikubho chibohu! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Patukajomola kulobhola, na nangocheni nobhola kabhele. Handa mundu johajola atendakuntangachianga Ngani Jammbone jengi, jijilekanile na jenijela jimujipokelinge, Annoongo apakuntenda mudu jonojwe ahikilwe na chikubho chibohu! <verse eid="GAL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Bholi, nangocheni nolea kondekwa na bhandu au Annoongo? Au mbala kwaabhajila bhandu? Handa ngateendite henela, nenga ngabhileopo na antumichi jwa Akilisito.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo atumwa na Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Akaanung'una bhangu, mbala muimanyange kubhee Ngani Jammbone jinakantangachianga ngabhoka kwa bhandu. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Nangapokela Ngani Jammbone kubhoka kwa bhandu wala nangajipata kubhoka kwa mundu joajola. Ayesu Kilisito mweene nga jwaatekunangia.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Mwangota ntekujoanga ngani ja chingatama lolo panddendita kuhobhalela mu genigala gabhayobhelile kupangana Bhayahudi, henela chinakalilagia kwa machili libhoga lya bhandu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito na kupala kulikoma. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Kweli, nakaapeta bhenibhala bhanakabhelekwa chaka chimo kwa kupotanila genigala gagayobhelilike kutendeka na Bhayahudi, nakachimila muno kupokela majigano kubhoka kwa akaatati bhitu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Nambo Annoongo, kwa umbone gwabhe, akibha atekuhagula hata tangu nangabhelekwa, akangema naatumikile. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />Ng'ang'anu tu atekunangia Mwana jwabhe henela chibhabhile ili ndangache Ngani Jammbone jabhe kwa bhandu bhangi bhanga Bhayahudi. Nenga nangaakonya mundu joajola, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />na panga kwela kujaula ku Yelusalemu kwa bhenibhala bhabhapatitinge kubhee akandundame tangu jangunenga, ngajaula oti ku Alabia, ngapena nakabhuja kabhele ku Damasiko. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Pajikapeta yaaka hitatu tu, ngapena nakajaula ku Yelusalemu nakakongana na Apetulo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu chilongelo cha Chigiliki chilobhola Akefa. Akefa nga lihina lyengi lya Apetulo </char></note> ngatama kwachabhe machobha komi na nhano, <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />konokwe nangaabhona andundame jongi ila nga Ayakobo, anung'una jwabhe Ayesu.<verse eid="GAL 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Gangani ganannyandikilanga, Annoongo amanya kubhee, nobholaopo unami.<verse eid="GAL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Machobha gannoongi nakajaula ku chilambo cha Silia na ku Kilikia. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Nambo, nenga nangamanyikana kwa chibhoga cha bhandu bhabhahohalela Akilisito bha konokwe ku Yudea. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Bhenaangota bhakajoanga tu kubhee, “Mundu jola jwaakatulagia penapo kandai, nangocheni atangacha Ngani Jammbone jelajela jibhakapala kujitinia.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Bahi, bhakaatukucha Annoongo ligongo lyangu.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Akaandundame bhangi bhankonda Apaulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Pahikapeta yaaka komi na ncheche, nakajaula kabhele ku Yelusalemu pamo na Abanaba, hela hela nakajaula pamo na Atito ili abhee pamo na nenga. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Nakajaula konokwe kwa kubhee Annoongo akahunukulila nyaule konokwe, ili nakaalobholelele kwa kuchiiya bhenibhala akanachilongola, jenijela Ngani Jammbone jindendakujitangacha kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. Nakatenda henela kwa kujogopa jikotokubhonekana handa ndendakubhutuka au nakabhutuka hiyoyo. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Bhakakondekana na nenga, hata handa Atito jwangabhee Agiliki, jwangaakulumikia kuhinwa, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />hela hela kukibha na bhandu bhangi bhabhakachitenda bhaahobhalela Akilisito bhabhakapalanga ahinwe. Bhena bhandu bhakachijingia kwa kupenya na kulolea ngani yitu ya kubhee kwitu hulu kutukibha nako kwa kulondekana na Akilisito, ili bhakombolange kututenda twaakaabhanda bha Malagilo ga Amusa. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Twenga twangakondana nabho hata kachoko ili ukweli gwa Ngani Jammbone jiigalile kwa mwangota machobha goa pangali kupela.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Nambo bhena akanachilongola bhabhakondekwa muno bhangabhee na chilebhe chiyono cha kunobholela. Kweli bhakaatopeanga muno, nambo kwangu nenga chenecho ngabha chilebhe kwa kubhee Annoongo nganpendelea mundu. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Badala jakwe, bhakamanyanga kubhee nakapekewa lihengo lya kutangacha Ngani Jammbone kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, handa henela chibhakaahobhalela Apetulo kwa lihengo lya kutangacha Ngani Jammbone kwa Bhayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Annoongo jwaakaatenda Apetulo kubhee andundame kwa Bhayahudi nga jojojo jwaakandenda nanenga kubhee andundame kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Bahi, Ayakobo na Apetulo na Ayohana, bhabhakabhonekanga kubhee akanachilongola akaakolo, bhakaimanyanga kubhee Annoongo akambekea umbone gonogwe, bhakatukamula twenga mabhoko, Abanaba na nenga, chibhee chilolelo cha chikukulu. Twenga tukakondananga kupangana lihengo kwa bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, na bhenaangota bhajaulanga kwa Bhayahudi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Nambo bhakatujopanga chilebhe chimo, twaakombokelange akahocho bhabhabhilinge mu chibhoga cha bhandu bhabhaahobhalela Akilisito, nanenga nakachimmila kupangana chikubho chenecho.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaulo aakelebhua Apetulo ku Antiokia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Apetulo pabhakaika ku chilambo cha Antiokia nakaakana palundwanje maana akibha alemwite. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Kandahi tangu ja bhandu bhangi kuhika kubhoka kwa Ayakobo, Apetulo akibha alyehe pamo na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi. Nambo bhena bhandu pabhakahikanga akajemeka kuchibhoa na kuchibheka kutali na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi, kwa kubhee akaajogopanga libhoga lya bhandu bhabhakulumikianga bhandu bhainangwe. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Kabhele Bhayahudi bhangi bhabhakahobhalela Akilisito bhakalondekana na Apetulo mu chikubho hecho cha undendemundu, na hata Abanaba jono akalondekana na undendemundu gwabhenji. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Bahi, panakabhona kubhee hikubho yabhenji ngalandana na ukweli gwa Ngani Jammbone, nakaalobholela Apetulo nnoongi ja bhandu bhoa, “Hata handa mwenga nga Anyahudi, na mwenga ntama handa ngabha Anyahudi. Hikomboleka bholi mwenga kwaakulumikianga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi kutama handa Bhayahudi?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bhayahudi na bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhaokolewanga kwa kuhobhalela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Kweli, twenga nga Bhayahudi kwa kubhelekwa, ngabha handa bhandu bha hilambo yengi yakubhee bhayahudi bhabhaakemanga bhapanga mabohu. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Nambo, tutendakuimanya kweli kubhee mundu ngakombola kondeekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo kwa kujeketela malagilo, ila kwa kwahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito. Twenga Bhayahudi kabhele tutekwahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito ili tukombole kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo kupetela kwahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito, na ngabha kwa kujeketela malagilo. Kwa kubhee jwaakwa mundu joajola jwaapakondeka nnoongi ja Annoongo kwa kujeketela Malagilo. <verse eid="GAL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Handa tupala tukoondekwe na Annoongo kwa kulondekana na Akilsito, twenga tupakubhonekana handa akaabohu, bholi chikubho heche chilangia kubhee Akilisito ajangatila kupangana mabohu? Hata kachoko! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Handa mbakuleka kukagula Malagilo ili ngombole kondekwa nnongi ja Annoongo, ngapena kabhele nakajemeka kukagula Malagilo penapo nga mbakubhee mbangine mabohu. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Kwa maana, nenga kwa kupetela malagilo, ndekugajomokea malagilo ili ngombole kutama ligongo lya kwaatumikila Annoongo. Nenga ndekujimoka pamo na Akilisito panchalaba, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />nangocheni ndendakutama, nambo ngabha nenga kabhele, ila Akilisito jwaatama nkati jangu, kutama chindendakutama nangocheni ndama kwa kuhobhalela, kuhobhalela kwangu kukubhokana na Mwana jwa Annoongo jwambalite, mpaka akagubhoa umomi gwabhe ligongo lyangu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Ngapala kugukana umbone gwa Annoongo. Handa mundu atekutendwa kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo kwa kukamuala malagilo, bahi kujomoka kwa Ayesu kwanga maana.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Kuhobhalela au Malagilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Mwangota mwa bhandu bha ku Galatia, ntekubhee mwa bhandu akaajinga? Bholi nga aganikia jwaatennoganga. Ngani ja kubhambwa kwa Ayesu Kilisito panchalaba jitekubhonekana pandaa nnoongi jinunji. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Ndendakupala kuimanya tu chilebhe chimo kubhoka kwachinunji. Bholi, nkapokelanga Mboomo jwa Annoongo kwa kupangana genigala gagapalikwa na malagilo au ligongo lya kujijoa na kuhobhalale Ngani Jammbone? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Bholi, mwangota nga mwa bhandu mwakaajinga namuna jenejo? Mwangota nkajemekanga kutama umomi gwinunji guyono kwa kujangatilwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo. Bholi, nangocheni mpalanga kujomola kwa machili ginunji mwaachinabhene? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Bholi, kulaga koha kunkalaganga mwangota kukibha hiyoyo tu? Hopo ngakomboleka! <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />Bholi, Annoongo atendakumpekeanga Mboomo jwabhe na kutenda hikubho yakangachika pakati jinunji ligongo ntekamulanga Malagilo ga Amusa, au ligongo ntendakujoanga Ngani Jammbone na kujihobhalela?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Majandiko ga Annoongo galobhola, “Abulahimu akaahobhalela Annoongo, na kwa kuhobhalela kwabhe, Annoongo akaakonda kubhee bhammbone.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Mpalikwanga kuhimanyanga yakubhee bhandu bhabhatekwahobhalela Annoongo, bhenabho nga bhana bha Ablahamu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Majandiko ga Annoongo kubhokela lolo gatekulangia kubhee Annoongo apakwateendanga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi kubhee bhandu bhabhakondekwa na Annoongo kwa ndela ja kwahobhalela Akilisito. Henela Majaandiko ga Annoongo gatekulongolela kuntangachia Ablahamu Ngani jammbone ja Akilisito, “Kupetela mwenga bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi bhoa gapakutendelwa gammbone.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Bahi, bhenibhala bhabhaahobhalela Annoongo bhapakutendelwa gammbone pamo na Ablahamu jwaahobhalile Annoongo.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Na bhoha bhabhakulupalila kuokolewa kwa kupangana gagapalikwa na Malagilo ga Amusa, bhenabho bhatekulaniwa na Annoongo. Ligongo, Majaandiko ga Annoongo gatekulobhola, “Joajola jwangagakamula na kugakwela goha gagajandikwe mu Malagilo ga Amusa, jonojwe atekulaaniwa na Annoongo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Nga kweli kubhee kugakagula Malagilo ngantenda mundu kondekwa nnongi ja Annoongo, kwa kubhee Majaandiko ga Annoongo gatekulobhola, “Mundu jwakondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo apakutama kwa kutandaikwa mu kwahobhalela Annoongo.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Nambo malagilo ngakulupalila kuhobhalela, ila mu Majaandiko ga Annoongo galobhola, “Mundu joajola jwaatama kwa kulupalila Malagilo apakutama kwa kupangana genigala gagapalikwa na Malagilo.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Akilisito akatukomboa kubhoka mu laana ja Malagilo kwa kuchitolela laana hejo ligongo litu, maana Majaandiko galobhola, “Atekulaaniwa mundu joajola jwaatekubhwamba panchalaba.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Chikubho heche chikateendeka ili gammbone gabhaatendilwe na Ablahimu gabhaahikilange bhandu bhanga Bhayahudi kupetela Akilisito, na kwa kuhobhalela, twaapokele jonijola Mboomo yakubhee Annoongo akatulobholela kubhee apakutupekea.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagilo na kukondananga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Akanung'una, mbakunnandanakia kubhoka mu umomi gwitu gwa kila lichobha. Nng'anikiange kwa chibhatekulagana bhandu bhabhele. Handa malagano gapakupanganika kwa bhandu bhabhele jwaakwa mundu jwaakombola kugabheka nnyenje au kujonjokea chilebhe. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Bahi, Ablahamu akapekewa lilagano pamo na ubhelei gwabhe. Majandiko ga ngalobhola, “Na ubhelehi gwabhee,” libhi na maana ja bhandu, ila galobhola, “Na mmelei jwakwe.” Nga jumo, na jonojwe nga Akilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Chimbala kulobhola nga chenjeni, Annoongo akatenda lilagano lyabhe, akalongola kweli, malagilo gakabhokela gajikapeta yaaka makomi komi ncheche na chelachini nnoongi jabhe, ngakombola kulitendebhua lyene lilagano na wala kugabhoa genigala gabhakalobhola Annoongo kubhee apakutupekea. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Maana, handa ngwahupa ja Annoongo jikulupalila Malagilo, bahi, ngakombola kulupalila kabhele genigala gabhakalobhola Annoongo kubhee apakutupekea. Nambo Annoongo kwa umbone gwabhe akampekea Ablahamu genigala gabhakalobola kubhee apakutupekea.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Kwaniki bahi gabhee Malagilo? Malagilo galabhekwa ligongo lya kulemwa mpaka chibhapakuhika jonijola mmelei jwa Ablahamu, jwaakakemwa mu genigala gabhakatulobholela Annoongo kubhee apakutupekea. Malagilo ga Amusa gakaletwa na antumichi jwa kunani kwa Annoongo, kwa ndela ja mundu jwaatenda bhandu bhakamulane mabhoko. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Nga kweli, jwaatenda bhandu bhakamulane mabhoko ngapalikwaopo ikibha chikubho cheene nga cha mundu jumo, nambo Annoongo nga jumo.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gagapalikwa na malagilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Bholi, malagilo gatendakanana na genigala gabhatulobholile Annoongo kubhee apakutupekea? Hata kachoko! Kwa kubhee handa Malagilo gagatekubhokekwa gangakombola kwaapekea bhandu umomi, bahi kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo kukapatikine kupetela Malagilo. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Nambo ngabha, Majaandiko ga Annoongo gatekulobhola kubhee chilambo chibhi pahi ja utabhala gwa mabohu, ili genigala gabhatekulobhola Annoongo kubhee apakutupekea kwa ndela ya kunhobhalela Ayesu Kilisito, bhenibhala bhakombolange kupekewa bhenibhala bhabhahobhalela Ayesu Kilisito.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Tangu kuhobhalela kongoni kwangahika, Malagilo gakatutenda kubhee akaatabhwa, tubhikulendela kuhobalela konokwe kutuhunukulikwe. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Bahi, gena Malagilo gakibha nachilongola ja kwaahikila Akilisito, ili tukombole kondekwa nnoongi ja Annoongo kwa kuhobhalela. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Nambo kwa kubhee konikola kuhobhalela kutekuhika, ngatandaikwa kabhele na Malagilo.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Kwa ndela ja kuhobhalela, mwangota mwabhoa ntekubhee bhana bha Annoongo mu kulondanika na Akilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />Mwangota mwabhoha mwantekubatichwa na kulondekana na Akilisito, nga handa ntekwaawala Akilisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Henela, kwaakwa kabhele kulekana pakati ja Bhayahudi na bhanga Bhayahudi, abhanda na mundu hulu, hanalome na haikege. Mwabhoa nga chilebhe chimo mu kulondanika na Akiisito. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Hikibha mwangota nga mwabhandu bha Akilisito, bahi mwangota nga bha ubhelehi gwa Ablahamu, na mpakupokelanga genigala gabhalobhwile Annoongo kubhee apakwaapekea.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Bahi, nongela henela, nnekelwa, akibha tangu mwana, ngalekanila na mmanda handa hibhile hilebhe yoa nga yabhe. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Wakati gonogwe goha habhile pahi ja bhandu bhabhalela na kujemela hiilebhe yabhe mpaka guhike muuda gugubhekitwe na Atati bhabhe. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Henela na twenga patukibha tangu twangagumanya ukweli, tukibha twakaabhanda bha mahoka bha bhabhatabhala bha pachilambo. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Nambo muuda gola gugupalikwa pagupakuhika, Annoongo bhakantuma Mwana jwabhee jwabhelikwe na haikege, akatama kwa kutandaikwa na malagilo, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />akombole kwaakomboa bhenibhala bhabhalongolelwa na malagilo ili twenga tutendekwe bhana bha Annoongo. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Kwa henela nangocheni mwangota nga bhanabhabhee, Annoongo atekuntuma Mbooomo jwa Annoongo mu mitima jinunji, Mboomo yakubhee atendakuguta, “Aba” Yakubhee maana gakwe nga “Atati” <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Bahi, mwenga ngabha akabhanda kabhele, bali amwana. Na chikibha nga mwana, bahi, mwenga mpakupokela goha Annoongo hibhammekilinge bhana bhabhe.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lipamba lya Apaulo kwa ngani ja Bhagalatia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Lolo mwangaamanga Annoongo na henela nkatumikilanga minnoongo yakubhee ngabha Annoongo jwa kweli. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Nambo nangocheni, kwa hela ntendakwaamnya Annoongo, au tulobhole ntendakumanyikana na Annoongo, kwaniki ntendakugabhujila kabhele maigano ga kandahi gagabhii gaahocho na gagatekupongokelwa? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Tangu ntekukuchihabhuanganga muno kwa kukombokela muno machobha, mihehi na yaaka! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />Ndendakujogopa yakubhee labuda lihengo lindendite ligongo linunji litakuhobha hiyoyo! <verse eid="GAL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Mwakaang'una, nanyamukanga mme handa nenga, kwa hela hata nenga ndekubhee handa mwangota. Mwangandendelanga ubou goha hola. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Ntendakuimanga yakubhee chitamwa changu helo chimbekihe napachi ja kuntangachianga Ngani jammbone kwa mala ja kujemeka. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Hata henela, wakati gonigola mwangameluanga wala kungananga ligongo lya chitamwa changu chibhii chingandenda kupangana henela, nambo nkambokelanga handa na antumichi bha Annnoongo, handa hela ngabhile Akilisito Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Nkibhanga na kuhangalala, nangocheni chibhokile chiniki? Ngombola kulongela ukweli kubhee handa ikakaomboeka nkagabhoa miho ginunji na kumbekeha nenga. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Bholi, nangocheni ndekubhee apwaati bhinunjiligongo kunnobholelanga kweli? <verse eid="GAL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Habhobho bhandu bhangi bhatendakumpupulikia mwangota, nambo nia jabhenji nga jammbone. Bhapalanga kunnekania nanenga ili mwangota mwaapapatilikie bhena bhandu. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Kwakweli nga chikubho cha mmbone machobha goha kwapupulikila bhangi mu hikubho ya mmbone, na ngabha tu wakati nena mile pamo namwangota. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Bhana bhangu, handa hela haikege bhakweti chitumbo chibhalaga wakati gwa kubheleka, nenga ndendakulaga kabhele kwa ajili jinunji mpaka penapo hali jabhee Akilichito pajipakuhalakikwa nkati jinunji. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />Ndendakulokolila handa nakibha pamo na mwangota nangocheni, labuda nakatentenbhuka lilobhe lyangu. kwa maana ndendekubhee na lipamba pamo namwangota nangocheni, maana ngapatite nchimamo gwa kupaa nnani jinunji! Ndekubhee na lipamba muno mwangota!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majigano kwa Hagali na Achala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nnobholelenge mwangota bhampalanga kuhukumulikwa na malagilo, bholi, ntekujoanga chiilongelekwa malagilo? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Jijaandikwe mu Majaandiko ga Annnoongo yakubhee Ablahamu akibha na bhana bhabhele, jumo kwa haikege abhanda, na jwa bhele haikege bhanga abhanda. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Joni jola jwa mwikege mmanda akabhelekwa kwa mmele, nambo jonijola jwa haikege bhanga habhanda akabhelekwa kubhokana Annoongo chibhakalobhola. <verse eid="GAL 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Hikubho heyo yakibha nnandanikio, hakaikege habho bhabhele nga kulandanikia kwa malagano mabhele, lya kwanja nga lyenilela lilikatendeka ku litombi ku Chinai, mwakilichi jwabhe nga Ahagali, na bhana bhabhee bhabhabhelikwe ku ubhanda. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Ahagali atendakuhakilicha litombi lya Chinai gugubhile ku Alabhia, na nga kulandanikia gwa chilambo cha ku Yeluchalemu cha nangocheni, kwa maana chenecho chibhile mu chilambo cha ubhanda pamo na bhandu bhabhatamanga monomwe. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Nambo ku Yeluchalemu ja kunani kwa Annoongo nga chilambo chichibhile hulu, na chene nga amma jwitu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Maana itekujaandikwa, “Nhangalale, mwenga mwangabhee ntonga, nkwehe lilobhe mwenga mwangapata kubheleka mwana, maana bhana bha jonijola jwaabhteulekana na analome nga bhajingi kupunda bha ahikege jwabhile na analome.” <verse eid="GAL 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Nangocheni, bahi, akanung'una bhangu, mwangota nga bhana bha Annoongo kubhokana naahadi ja Annoongo handa jenijela ja Aisaka. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Nambo handa yela machobha gala jonijola mwana jwaabhelikwe kwa ndela ja mmele, akalaagia jonijola jwaabhelikwe kwa uwecho gwa Mboomo jwa Annoongo, hela hela nga chiibhile mpaka nangocheni. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Nambo Majaandiko ga Annoongo galongela bholi? Bhalobhola, “Mwabhenge haikege abhanda pamo na mwana jwaabhe, maana mwana mmanda jwapakupokelaopo kulandana na mwaana jwa ahikege jonojwe” <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Henela bahi, twenga ngabha bhana bha habhanda ila twenga nga bhana bha haikege jwaabhii hulu.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Mmekange kwangabhee ubhanda gwinunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Akilisito akatupekea uhulu, akapala tuigalile tukotokubhee ubhanda. Bahi, nyemange ndandali wala nkotokondanga kabhele kubhee akaabhanda. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Nnyoanikiange! nenga Apaulo ganagalobhola namwangota! Handa nkonditiinge kuhinwanga, Akilisito apakubhonekana ngabha chilebhe kwaachinunji. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Nongela kabhele pandaa, Kila mundu jwaakonda kuhinwa ipalikwa kukamula malagilo goha. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Handa ntendakulolekeanga kutendwa kubhee bhandu bha kuutongamanika kwa ndela ja malagilo, bahi, ntekuchibhekanga kutali na Annoongo. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Kwa upande gwitu, twenga tutendakulolea kupanganwa kubhee bhandu bhammbone nnoongi ja Annoongo kwa ndela ja kuhobhalela na kwa ndela ja machili ga Mboomo jwa Annoongo, tutendakulendela chikubho hecho. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Maana ikibha tutekulondana na Akilichito Yechu, kunhinanga au pangali kuhinwa kwanga maana. Nambo chichibhii chammbone nga kuhobhalela kukutandaikwa na kupalana. <verse eid="GAL 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Mkibhanga ntendakupangana hikubho yammbome mu kutama kwinu, bholi nga aganiki jwaakannekanila ili nkotokugujeketela ukweli. <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Jwaatendite henela nga Annoongo jwaatekunkemanga. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Gangani majigano ga unami galandana na ngedule kachoko jijitutumua ukobha nnyingi. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Kubhokana na kulondekana kwitu na Hangwana, ndendakulupalila muno tupakulandana mu kuganikia kwitu. Kabhele mundu joajola jwapakunhangalana apakupotekwa. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Na kwa upande gwangu, akanung'una bhangu, handa tangu ndendakutangacha yakubhee ipalikwa kuhinwa, kwa niki bahi, tangu mbotekwe na Bhayahudi? Handa ikabhile henela, gandendakuntangachianga kwa ngani ja Akilisito gakaletiteopo honi joha jela. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Mbaya bhenebho bhabhankulumikinga nhinangwe! bhakachiina akaachina bhenenji. <verse eid="GAL 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Mwangota akanung'una, nkakemwanga na Annoongo ili nnekanilwe kubhoka ku ubhanda. Nambo kulekenilwa kwitu kulokolila kwinunji, ila ntumikilanange kwa upaliho. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Maana malagilo goha gakwela mu kukamula amuli jenjeni jimo jijilobhola, “Mwapale handami ajinu handa chinchipala mwabhene.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Nambo ikibha ntendakulumananga na kutaunana handa hinyama yakalipa ya kumanayahi, nchilolekeange ili nkotokoamananga mwakaachinabhene.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umomi gugutandaikwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Bahi, nongela henela, kutama kwiununji kutandaikwe na Mboomo jwa Annoongo, na mwangota nkotokukagulanga kulokolilwa kwa mimele jinu kuntekubhelekwa nako. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Maana, kuhilokolila hikubho ya pachilambo hintenda kupangana yeniyela hitendakulekanila na genigala gabhapala Annoongo, na genigala gabhapala Mboomo jwa Annoongo gantenda kulekenilana na kulokolila kwa mmele kuntekubhelekwa nako. Yene hikubho hibhle hitendakukanana ligongo helyo ngakombolanga kupangana gampalanga mwaachinabhene. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Nambo handa ntendakulongolelwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo, bahi ngalongolelwa kabhele na malagilo. <verse eid="GAL 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Bahi, hikubho hiibhokana nakulokolilwa kubohu kwa mmele nga, ngongola, ulolohi, uhakwa, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />kuchalila hidimu, uhabhi, upwati, bhulwa, bwihu, lilaka, hilema, mataukano, mpwato <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />lilaka, kolelwa, kulyee muno na hikubho yengi handa yeneyo. Ndendakunyamukanga handa chindekulongolela kunnyamukanga, bhandu bhabhatendanga hikubho heyo ngapatanga umwenye gwa Annoongo gubhee gwabhenji. <verse eid="GAL 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Nambo mundu jwaatandaikwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo abhii na Upalio, kuhachuka, kuhengwa, kuhimbalila, umbone, ntima gwa kujangatila bhangi, na kuaminika, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />Kuchitimalika na kuchiibhila kupangana mabohu. Gakwa malagilo gagakombola kukana hikubho heyo. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Bhenibhala bhabhabhilinge bhandu bha Akilisito bhatekubhamba kulokolila kwabhennji kwa mimele jabhenji pamo na kuganikila kwabhenji kubohu. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Tutaamite kwa kujangatilwa na Mboomo jwa Annoongo, na tukagule na kutandaikwa kwabhenji. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Bahi, tukotokuchipuna, tukotokuandamulananga wala kubhonelananga bwihu.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s">Tuhimbalilane na Kujangatilana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Akaannung'una bhangu, handa mwabhonite amundu teno atekulemwa, bahi, mwangota bhabhantandaa na Mboomo ja Annoongo mwanyamuke mundu jonojwe kwa kuchitimalika, nambo nchilolekeenge nkotokujingilanga mu kujigwa konokwe. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Nnyangatilanange mu hindondo yinunji na henela mpakwela malagilo ja Akilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Handa mundu apakuchibhona kubhee nga jwammbone kongo abhi ngabha jwammbone, jonojwe apakuchitemba mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Nambo kila jumo na achilolekee henela chibhatama. Handa atendakutama kwa kupangana hikubho yammbone, bahi apakombola kuhanagalala pangali kuchilandanikia na chibhatama mundu jongi. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Maana kila jumo apalikwa kuhitola hindondo yabhe mwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Bahi, jwajigana lilobhe lya Annoongo na achikichane na jwaajigana jwabhe mu genigala gammbone. <verse eid="GAL 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Nkotokutembekwa na bhandu, Annoongo ngatendelwa mbeenje. Chibhaapandite mundu nga chiapakuuhuna. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Jwaapangana handa mmele gwabhe chigupala, apakuhuna mabohu, na jonojwe jwaapangana hikubho hiibhajilwa Mboomo jwa Annoongo apakupata umomi gwa machobha goa pangali kupela. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Bahi, tukotokutotokela kutenda gammbone, maana handa ngahekeleka ntima, tupakuhuna kwa muuuda gwabhe <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Henela, tukibha tangu na muda, twatendelange bhandu bhoha gammbone, muno kwa akaajitu bhabhahobhalela Akilisito.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Majigano ga kupela na chalaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Nnolange henela chinannyandikilinge kwa majandiko makolongwa, kwa lubhoko lwangu namwene. <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Bhenibhala bhabhapalanga kubhonekana bhakuhalala kwa hikubho ya mmele nga bhabhapalanga kunkulumikianga mwangota bhanhinange. Bhatenda henela ligongo limo tu, kupala bhenabho bhene bhakotokulaganganga ligongo lya kujigana tu kwa ngani ja nchalaba gwa Akilisito. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Maana, habhobho bhene bhahinitinge ngakamulanga malagilo, bhampalanga mwangota bhanhinange bhapatange kuchipunilanga alama jenejo mummele jinunji. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Nambo nenga nichipunilaopo ng'o chohachela ila nchalaba gwa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito, maana kwa ndela ja nchalaba hogwe hikubho yoa pachilambo gangalimaana kwaachangu ligongo ndekubhee handa mundu junyomwiike mu hikubho yeneyo. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Kuhinwa au pangakuhinwanga ngabha chilebhe, nambo chikubho chichibhii chikolongwa nga mundu kutendwa kubhee jwa nangocheni. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Bhabhaakagulanga kutandaikwa konokwe, ndendakuntakianga kuhengwa na kiha, kuhengwa na kiha kwa bandu bha ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="GAL 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Bahi, nangocheni mundu johajola akotokunjumbua kabhele, maana mii na chilangio mummele gwangu jijilangia kubhee nenga nga jwa Ayesu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Mwakanung'una, umbone gwa Hangwana bhitu Ayesu Kilisito jibhee na mwangota. Jibhee henela.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>